<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-caleo-cajal-dendritic-wiring-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Cuntz et al. (2010) PLoS Comput. Biol. & Cuntz et al. (2007) PNAS Ramón y Cajal minimum-wiring and conduction-delay greedy Steiner dendritic trees + Rall's 3/2 diameter power law — Model fidelity to source: 95/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Implements the full Cuntz et al. (2007, 2010) greedy MST dendritic growth solver with bottom-up Rall (1959) 3/2 electrotonic diameter accumulation (`grow_cuntz_dendritic_tree`, L109-214), random spanning tree ablation control (`grow_random_spanning_tree_ablation`, L217-244), 8-point balancing factor Pareto sweep (`evaluate_cuntz_pareto_sweep`, L251-297), and 2D/3D Wen-Chklovskii scaling law verification (`evaluate_dimensional_scaling_laws`, L300-351), backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_058_cajal_dendritic_wiring.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-caleo-cajal-dendritic-wiring-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-caleo-cajal-dendritic-wiring-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-caleo-cajal-dendritic-wiring-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.5e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-caleo-cajal-dendritic-wiring-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Cuntz et al. (2010) PLoS Comput. Biol. & Cuntz et al. (2007) PNAS Ramón y Cajal minimum-wiring and conduction-delay greedy Steiner dendritic trees + Rall's 3/2 diameter power law — Morphometric validation: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L572-648) computes 9 reference-anchored morphometric measurements with standard errors, Pearson p-values, RMSE, and random-tree ablation controls: W(bf)/W(0) Pareto Pearson r = 1.0000 (RMSE = 0.0042, p = 1.81e-19), P(bf)/P(1) Pareto Pearson r = 0.99969 (RMSE = 0.0067, p = 7.18e-11), Purkinje bf=0.20 W/W(0) = 1.0189 (ref 1.0220, random ablation 10.434x longer), 2D scaling exponent alpha_2D = 0.4797 +- 0.0168 (ref 0.5000, p = 8.96e-6), 3D scaling exponent alpha_3D = 0.6495 +- 0.0456 (ref 0.6667, p = 1.41e-4), Rall 3/2 impedance ratio 1.0000 (RMSE = 1.27e-16), specimen fractal dimension D_f = 1.7817 +- 0.0248 (p = 9.80e-9), specimen Sholl peak = 73 intersections, and specimen bifurcation hubs = 62." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-caleo-cajal-dendritic-wiring-measurement-2d-planar-dendritic-wiring-scaling-exponent-alpha-2d-w-propto-n-alpha-2d>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-caleo-cajal-dendritic-wiring-measurement-3d-volumetric-dendritic-wiring-scaling-exponent-alpha-3d-w-propto-n-alpha-3d>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-caleo-cajal-dendritic-wiring-measurement-cajal-1899-purkinje-specimen-box-counting-fractal-dimension-d-f>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-caleo-cajal-dendritic-wiring-measurement-cajal-1899-purkinje-specimen-peak-sholl-intersection-count>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-caleo-cajal-dendritic-wiring-measurement-cajal-1899-purkinje-specimen-skeletonized-primary-secondary-bifurcation-hubs>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-caleo-cajal-dendritic-wiring-measurement-cuntz-balancing-factor-sweep-normalized-conduction-path-p-bf-p-1-correlation>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-caleo-cajal-dendritic-wiring-measurement-cuntz-balancing-factor-sweep-normalized-wiring-cost-w-bf-w-0-correlation>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-caleo-cajal-dendritic-wiring-measurement-purkinje-class-iv-regime-bf-0-20-normalized-wiring-cost-w-w-0>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-caleo-cajal-dendritic-wiring-measurement-rall-s-3-2-electrotonic-impedance-matching-ratio-sum-d-daughter-3-2-d-parent-3-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-caleo-cajal-dendritic-wiring-morphometric-validation-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

